{
 "file": "story/spt/f06_060_161_00_t014.spt",
 "lines": [
  {
   "i": 1031,
   "src": "d5ffc2c5cce7",
   "t": "{{main}}"
  },
  {
   "i": 1042,
   "src": "bb19519099ae",
   "t": "It should reach much farther than that."
  },
  {
   "i": 1045,
   "src": "a85bc8514226",
   "t": "This is absolutely wrong."
  },
  {
   "i": 1059,
   "src": "fccecf67eac2",
   "t": "Maybe there's some other problem left..."
  },
  {
   "i": 1071,
   "src": "d5ffc2c5cce7",
   "t": "{{main}}"
  },
  {
   "i": 1080,
   "src": "c806b754f0c2",
   "t": "No way!"
  },
  {
   "i": 1088,
   "src": "fd30d1b308f4",
   "t": "If there were a problem, there'd be even\nmore problems!"
  },
  {
   "i": 1091,
   "src": "099c6bcb6093",
   "t": "The problem is that it IS working\nproperly!"
  },
  {
   "i": 1101,
   "src": "1e52ed43bbf1",
   "t": "{{mio}}"
  },
  {
   "i": 1107,
   "src": "cbc64168269c",
   "t": "So which problem is the problem?"
  },
  {
   "i": 1117,
   "src": "d5ffc2c5cce7",
   "t": "{{main}}"
  },
  {
   "i": 1123,
   "src": "0c883912f6b0",
   "t": "The cause must be outside."
  },
  {
   "i": 1134,
   "src": "dd26fdc8bba4",
   "t": "Outside...?"
  },
  {
   "i": 1150,
   "src": "d5ffc2c5cce7",
   "t": "{{main}}"
  },
  {
   "i": 1161,
   "src": "842f0aa0118c",
   "t": "There's a frequency that interferes with"
  },
  {
   "i": 1164,
   "src": "419dad348d9a",
   "t": "the Medalia's sound waves and cancels\nthem out."
  },
  {
   "i": 1175,
   "src": "f3d4e266d81b",
   "t": "Jamming radio waves-- no,"
  },
  {
   "i": 1178,
   "src": "1e867fabfd05",
   "t": "you mean there are jamming sound\nwaves?"
  },
  {
   "i": 1190,
   "src": "d5ffc2c5cce7",
   "t": "{{main}}"
  },
  {
   "i": 1199,
   "src": "f375c7f0be27",
   "t": "Ah, yes, yes!"
  },
  {
   "i": 1206,
   "src": "f1f3a69763ae",
   "t": "{{exploration_club_pres_kunigiku}}"
  },
  {
   "i": 1215,
   "src": "da74b66b9801",
   "t": "Is it something artificial?"
  },
  {
   "i": 1225,
   "src": "d5ffc2c5cce7",
   "t": "{{main}}"
  },
  {
   "i": 1234,
   "src": "7311e006ce9f",
   "t": "I don't know."
  },
  {
   "i": 1242,
   "src": "33d39b24c5d6",
   "t": "Even in nature, there's no such thing as\nsilence."
  },
  {
   "i": 1245,
   "src": "652d7687cb86",
   "t": "There are always lots of different\nsounds flying around."
  },
  {
   "i": 1260,
   "src": "f6a336126b0a",
   "t": "I can't tell which one is the problem."
  },
  {
   "i": 1263,
   "src": "944314596538",
   "t": "But I can't think of anything else."
  },
  {
   "i": 1271,
   "src": "cc0584a6ce59",
   "t": "..."
  }
 ]
}
